+  #   "All Reduce config: ..."                 CustomAllReduceV2 (SGLang) at setup;
+  #   "Registering <N> cuda graph addresses"   CustomAllreduce V1 — vLLM's and
+  #         SGLang's shared lineage, which says NOTHING at init and only speaks
